// Not cased: start_engine calls start(), whose play() loop never ends in a
// case for the reason mb.id's note gives (start() re-initialises mb itself,
// so no given's quit setting survives to play()'s loop).
// term_init's seed parameter is int, and ticks() returns word: passing
// the word straight through narrows it inline, which the compiler now
// rejects, so main() names an int local first and calls this with it.
start_engine(int seed) {
  term_init(60, 20, seed);
  term_setup();
  start();
} return void;
